            'LinkedIn vs Google Ads for logistics B2B &mdash; which is better?' => '<strong>Both, in different funnel stages.</strong> <strong>Google Ads</strong> wins on high-intent procurement queries (&ldquo;freight forwarder mumbai&rdquo;, &ldquo;3PL warehousing pune&rdquo;) &mdash; immediate intent, fast conversion. <strong>LinkedIn</strong> wins for awareness + thought-leadership + ABM with supply-chain executives. Typical split: 50&ndash;60% Google for immediate lead-gen, 40&ndash;50% LinkedIn for relationship + ABM.',

